title: Marline_Intro_CIMETIERE
position: 262,0.5
---
<<ResetStade Marline>>
<<if $visitedMarlineIntro_CIM>>
<<jump Marline_Salute>>
<<endif>>
Bulle: Grandma, don't tell me you're following me?  #line:08afacb 
<<BulleAnim Angry>>
Bulle : Did dad hire you as a spy? #line:0d0bc7b 
<<BulleAnim Idle>>
Marline: Hey, you think I don't have a life when you're not here?  #line:0487db0 
Marline: I'm an active grandmother. #line:099f64b 
Bulle: Why are you here then? #line:06ca788 
Marline: It's none of your business, you little creep.
Marline : What are <b>YOU</b> doing in this godforsaken area? #line:0423d25 
->Bulle: It's a great place!
    Bulle: It's so nice here! #line:0d79510 
    Marline: Ah! Please update your standards!  #line:0caab8a 
    Marline: It's the second most boring place after your <color=\#48BC0D>parents'farm</color>.  #line:06a90d3 
    <<BulleAnim Sad>>
    Marline: You need to see new horizons!  #line:097700e
    Astère: <i>Like Animal Crossing.</i>
    Marline: Take a walk outside, get some color. You look like a poor dried out octopus. #line:079b2bf 
    <<BulleAnim Angry>>
    Bulle: <size=800%><b>WHAT??</b></size> #line:02d4b9e 
    Bulle: I met a <color="purple">gang</color="purple"> that told me I was fresh! #line:09c1107 
    <<BulleAnim Idle>>
->Bulle: You're here too!
    Bulle: You're here too! #line:0edd415 
    Marline: I'm not staying, I was just passing by.  #line:02ff44f 
    Marline: And stop meddling in my business! Mind your own business for a whale!  #line:00086aa 
    Marline: Meet other people than me! #line:0f8896e 
    <<BulleAnim Angry>>
    Bulle: I've seen other people!  #line:0c8d783 
    Bulle: Besides there's even a <color="purple">gang</color="purple"> that told me I was fresh! #line:019498c 
    <<BulleAnim Idle>>
->Bulle: Meet people <<if $seum < 20 >> #line:2188d06
    Bulle: It's in the most isolated of places that one meets the best people.   
    Astère: <i>Very happy to have met this whale skeleton...</i> #line:0393aec 
    Marline: I didn't know you had such an adventurous spirit my bubble! It's beautiful.  #line:04c8432 
    <<RelationMarline 1>>
    <<BulleAnim Star>>
    Bulle : Oooh yeah! There's even a <color="purple">gang</color="purple"> that told me I was fresh! #line:00e6b6f 
    <<BulleAnim Idle>>
Marline: Fresh??? #line:0102f25 
Marline: No, no, no, that's not how you should be.  #line:05e2134 
Marline: The only thing that has to be fresh here is this <color=\#FFC300>can</color=\#FFC300>.  #line:0c079fb 
Marline: Here Bulle, you can use it! #line:03e3015 
<<BulleAnim Star>>
<<ReceiveItem Canette>>
Bulle: What do I need it for? #line:0fd3c40 
<<BulleAnim Idle>>
Marline: To become a great adventurer Bubble! But be careful, you must use it at the right moment! #line:0113524 
Bulle: Why? #line:0fd9e78 
Marline: You'll see, shoo! #line:0a56c03 
