title: Marline_Story_CIMETIERE_0
position: 262,0.5
---
<<if $visitedMarlineStory0_CIM>>
<<jump Marline_Salute>>   
<<endif>>
Marline: ---
Marline: I'm proud of you Bulle, despite your accident, you're not afraid of adventure! #line:06afd3d 
Bulle: What accident? #line:05e6308 
Marline: Ah, you don't remember?  #line:09e9939 
Marline: That's why your stupid parents cut off contact with me. #line:023e211 
Astère: <i>It's flashback time. Get your popcorn ready.</i> #line:0c25dae 
Marline: When you were still a little fish, I took you to explore the <color=\#48BC0D>forest</color=\#48BC0D>.  #line:0b730c6 
Marline: You were not very agile, Bulle, you tripped on a shell fell and pierced your bubble.  #line:07ee56f 
Marline: I got you home before you even had time to notice it! #line:005b2be 
Marline: But your father is fragile. He made a big deal of it and forbade me to see you. #line:09b6b5e
<<BulleAnim Angry>> 
Bulle: But it's really mean! #line:0ef2729 
Marline: And according to him I'm the bad one! It's easy to talk behind someone's back!  #line:01685bb 
<<BulleAnim Idle>>
<<wait 0.5>>
Marline: Mind you, I was never there so it's probably my fault. #line:05d0b99 
Bulle: And even Grandpa thought you were mean? #line:0997969 
Marline: No, your grandfather was very nice... #line:0b9770f 
Marline: He forgave everything and was always there to welcome me back from my trip.  #line:0de6b98 
Marline: <size=70%>But because of me, he couldn't see you either.</size=70%> #line:0e7712f 
<<BulleAnim Sad>>
Bulle: That's so sad... #line:06b6069 
<<BulleAnim Idle>>
<<wait 0.7>>
Marline: ...  #line:0003341 
Marline: <size=150%>Hey!</size=150%> No time for sadness when you're an adventurer, Bulle!  #line:08df558 
Marline: We look towards the future and say bye-bye to the past!  #line:07b4bcb 
Marline: Besides, don't you have an adventure to go on? Keep moving instead of talking to me! #line:0dc7ad0 
<<set $visitedMarlineStory0_CIM to true>>
<<jump Marline_Option>>
===
title: Marline_Story_CIMETIERE_1
