<<endif>>
Marline : ---
Bulle: What was your best trip grandma? #line:02d4858 
Marline : Bulle! I already told you to stop chatting with me... #line:00a08ad 
<<wait 0.7>>
<<BulleAnim Happy>>
Marline: But you're lucky, <mspace=0.7em>I love</mspace=0.7em> telling my life story.  #line:09a46f8 
<<BulleAnim Idle>>
Marline: It was in the <color="\#48BC0D>kelp forest</color="\#48BC0D>. #line:03e7698 
->Bulle: Don't care!
    Bulle: I actually don't care hahaha! <<if $seum > 20 >> #line:1b97665  
    Marline: Very well, continue your adventure without my advice in this case. #line:06cf25b 
    <<BulleAnim Sad>>
    Bulle: It's okay I'm kidding grandma...you're not funny. #line:0f2040b 
    <<BulleAnim Idle>>
->Bulle: What? #line:0c2510c 
    Marline: It reminds me of your grandfather, it was the only place he liked joining my trips to.  #line:0384e8b 
    Marline: But you already know that, I'll tell you about a place further away that you might like... #line:03bd516 
->Bulle: My favorite place!
    Bulle: It's my favorite place too! #line:0ac2d8c 
    <<BulleAnim Sad>>
    Marline: You're not serious Bulle? This place sucks, there's nothing but <color=\#FFC300>algae</color=\#FFC300> and hippies. #line:0040d0f 
    <<BulleAnim Idle>>
    Astère: <i>But Marline has everything in common with the hippies...</i> #line:0da58d0 
->Bulle: Hotu's spot!
    Bulle: Yep, that's <color="purple">Hotu</color="purple"> the rock's spot! <<if $seum < 20 >> #line:20eb581  
    Marline: You know <color="purple">Hotu</color="purple">? He was a great champion back in the day.  #line:0cee896 
    Marline: It brings back such good memories. There was <color="purple">Napopo</color> too... #line:0fd77cd
    <<RelationMarline 1>>
    <<wait 0.7>> 
    Marline : Oh look, this <color=\#FFC300>battery</color=\#FFC300> is from that time. I give it to you, it will surely be more useful to you than to me! #line:0c9f204 
    <<BulleAnim Star>>
    Bulle: So cool! Thanks grandma!!! #line:06d96a0 
    <<BulleAnim Idle>>
    Marline: But on another subject... #line:04955e4 
Marline: My favorite place is not far from here.  #line:079a3fe 
Marline: I was going there to move my shell and meet partners. #line:0c324c5 
Bulle: Partners? #line:07dde2e 
Marline: Partners to make l... #line:02965dc 
<<SetSpeed 500>>
Astère: Dance! #line:022b531 
<<SetSpeed 30>>
Marline: Besides, as an adventurer, I didn't have time to build relationships.  #line:0ef7899 
Marline: One night here, one night there. You have to rely on no one and no one relies on you.  #line:074f205 
Marline: No time to mess around! #line:056b815 
Bulle: So you never had any friends? #line:07fb59b 
Marline: No, what for?  #line:0d908cb 
<<SetSpeed 10>>
Marline: An.  #line:0d2cfac 
Marline: Adventurer.  #line:0fd08fe 
Marline: Must.  #line:0833fcb 
Marline: Fend.  #line:08252ad 
Marline: For.  #line:0c8f133 
Marline: <b><size=600%>THEMSELF!!!</size=600%></b>  #line:03db4e4 
<<SetSpeed 30>>
<<BulleAnim Sad>>
Bulle: It's so lame. I've made friends since I left my mom and dad's house. #line:0545a5a 
<<BulleAnim Idle>>
Marline: Hmph Bulle, I had friends too when I was your age, but nowadays there's nobody. #line:0045240 
Marline: When you're an adult everyone abandons you, believe me!  #line:0e56b78 
Marline: In the end, there's only adventure left for you! #line:0000ca1 
Bulle: I don't believe you. #line:07ee23a 
Marline: As you wish... #line:0431058 
Marline: Go on your way then. And you will see with your own eyes! #line:0598532 
<<set $visitedMarlineStory1_CIM to true>>
<<jump Marline_Option>>
